    {
      "goal": "Research ideal pitch deck structure for a second location expansion, including what top pitch deck experts recommend. Fetch content from: the '50 startup pitch decks reviewed' article (https://www.focusedchaos.co/p/i-reviewed-50-startup-pitch-decks), Barista Life coffee shop investor pitch deck guide (https://baristalife.co/blogs/blog/coffee-shop-investor-pitch-deck), Rise Accounting coffee shop expansion guide (https://riseaccounting.co.uk/coffee-shop-expansion/), and StoryPitchDecks financial slides guide (https://www.storypitchdecks.com/post/deep-research-what-goes-into-startup-pitch-deck-financial-slides). Focus on expansion-specific slides, how to showcase Location 1 traction, and second-location narrative structure.",
