    {
      "goal": "Research how to present 3 years of P&L data compellingly in a pitch deck, and find real examples of successful coffee shop fundraises and pitch decks. Fetch content from: PandaDoc financials pitch deck template (https://www.pandadoc.com/financials-pitch-deck-template/), PitchDeckCreators financials slide guide (https://www.pitchdeckcreators.com/blog-posts/pitch-deck-financials-slide), Copper Cow Coffee pitch deck (https://www.pitchdeckhunt.com/pitch-decks/copper-cow-coffee), AngelMatch coffee pitch decks (https://angelmatch.io/pitch_decks/by-industry/coffee), and the VC-funded coffee playbook article (https://intelligence.coffee/2025/08/the-vc%E2%80%91funded-playbook-for-coffee/). Find specific visualization techniques, storytelling frameworks for financial data, and real examples.",
